 "notes": "Turntable list (45 models) turned into 10 archetypes; Technics/Rega/Pro-Ject models became versions. Dropped as near-duplicates: Pro-Ject A1.2, E1 Phono, Juke Box E1, RPM 5 Carbon, T2 Super Phono, T2 W, X8 B; Technics SL-1015/1025/SL-50C; EAT Forte S. Brief items not attested on a retrieved page and left out: Lenco L75 (forum snippets only), Dual 1019/1219 (Dual article names no models), Braun PS, Clearaudio/VPI archetypes, Koetsu, Lyra, Goldring, Shure V15, AT-OC9, Ortofon RMG-309, Rega RB300 and Planar 3 years, Linn Karousel 2021 (page says March 2020), Keith Monks, Klaudio and Pro-Ject VC-S cleaners. AR XA year from AR article (1963); the LP12 article gives 1961. Plinth kept with types only plus Linn Trampolin baseboard."
